  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Female entrepreneurs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinnligt f&#xf6;retagande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a training programme for female entrepreneurs in Lithuania. The aim of the project is to improve the ability of the women in Lithuania as an entrepreneur in common and their skill to export in special, to strengthen their position on the labour market and to stimulate the equality between female and male entrepreneurs in Lithuania.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklingsm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka kvinnornas position p&#xe5; den litauiska arbetsmarknaden som helhet men &#xe4;ven att skapa j&#xe4;mlika m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r kvinnor och m&#xe5;n att starta och driva egna f&#xf6;retag.</narrative>
  </description>
